      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"34\">THREE PEOPLE, ONE EXAM</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">Different starting lines, identical finish line</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"150\" width=\"940\" height=\"280\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">DESHAWN WILLOUGHBY, 24</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">NCRA-accredited CIM associate program, Ohio</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"283\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Supervised practicum in a CoC hospital registry</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"321\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">No health care job before he enrolled</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"382\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"21\">ROUTE 1 - sat the exam the summer he graduated</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"450\" width=\"940\" height=\"280\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">PRIYA SANDOVAL, 39</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"545\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">RHIT, eleven years as an inpatient coder</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"583\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Moved to registry assistant: casefinding, follow-up</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"621\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Added one online cancer registry course</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"682\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"21\">ROUTE 2 - about two years from first path report</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"750\" width=\"940\" height=\"280\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">MARCUS TOIVONEN, 52</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"845\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">BSN oncology navigator, 90-bed rural hospital</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"883\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Inherited abstracting when the registrar retired</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"921\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Science prerequisites already met in nursing school</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"982\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"21\">ROUTE 2 - needed registry coursework and hours only</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Three candidate profiles showing how the education and experience routes serve different starting points"
